      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. To be more precise for my paper, can you elaborate on the specific \"adaptation hypotheses\" regarding temperament? For instance, what are the arguments regarding why certain ancestral environments might have favored more aggressive or high-risk temperaments in some populations compared to others? I'm looking for the specific logic used in those theories to link environmental stressors to those specific behavioral traits.",
